OL,6,CG1982FFrances Coverdale presents a BBC
OL,7,FTV news programme for the first time.
OL,8,
OL,9,CG1986FPhilip Hayton co-presents the
OL,10,FSix o'Clock News (BBC One) for the
OL,11,Ffirst time.
OL,12,
OL,13,CG1989FJohn Humphrys returns to news
OL,14,Fpresenting on BBC TV, co-presenting the
OL,15,FSix o'Clock News (BBC One). He had
OL,16,Fpreviously been a TV news presenter
OL,17,Ffrom June 1981 to December 1984.
